{
  "name": "01 · AI Sohbet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💬 AI Sohbet\nUygulamadaki **Sohbet**, **AI Koç** ve **PDF ile Konuş** ekranları bu akışı kullanır.\n\n**Adres:** `POST /webhook/chat`\n**Gelen:** `{ \"message\": \"...\" }` → uygulama mesaja ders adını, ilgili ders notlarını ve önceki mesajları ekleyerek gönderir.\n**Dönen:** `{ \"success\": true, \"reply\": \"...\" }`\n\nModel: `qwen2.5:7b` · bağlam penceresi 8192 token",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "978765a7-ee68-4bcd-b3f7-7a9597f7f8c5",
      "name": "Açıklama",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "chat",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0ff9b73c-11cd-4701-98c8-1aed796fe1a8",
      "name": "Uygulamadan İstek",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "a6cbab24-01a8-4a5b-bbdd-e5c814ea738b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const msg=($input.first().json.body||{}).message;\nif(!msg||!String(msg).trim()){return [{json:{valid:false,error:'Mesaj bos olamaz.'}}];}\nconst sys='Sen Turkce konusan, sabirli ve ogretici bir universite egitim asistanisin. Kullanici mesajindaki kurallara, ders bilgisine ve ders notlarina uy. Cevaplarini Markdown ile duzenli yaz.';\nreturn [{json:{valid:true,ollamaBody:{model:'qwen2.5:7b',stream:false,options:{temperature:0.5,num_ctx:8192},messages:[{role:'system',content:sys},{role:'user',content:String(msg)}]}}}];"
      },
      "id": "e9664429-e032-420e-b7f6-bcc100622ad2",
      "name": "İsteği Doğrula",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fa80880e-e3f1-4770-ab34-ebeec81f2f3a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "eb48f10c-5408-4544-8cb1-e15ed69da6a8",
      "name": "Geçerli mi?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://ollama:11434/api/chat",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.ollamaBody) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 200000
        }
      },
      "id": "29086b62-d6ca-4279-976d-48e44c587157",
      "name": "Ollama (qwen2.5)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        -60
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const j=$input.first().json;\nconst reply=j.message&&j.message.content;\nif(!reply){return [{json:{success:false,error:'Yapay zeka yanit veremedi. Tekrar deneyin.'}}];}\nreturn [{json:{success:true,reply}}];"
      },
